# Throwaway NEAR testnet account used by the AgentSig demo.
# Create one at https://testnet.mynearwallet.com (faucet-funded) or via near-cli-rs.
#
# TWO files, two keys (never mix them):
# - agent/.env         -> the FULL-ACCESS key. Used ONLY by the contract
#   scripts (deploy.ts, redeploy.ts, add-scoped-key.ts, set_policy).
#   The runtime REFUSES to run with this key.
# - agent/.env.agent   -> the SCOPED function-call key (receiver = the
#   policy contract, method = request_signature only). Written by
#   contract/add-scoped-key.ts; the runtime prefers it over .env.
# Both files are gitignored. This example shows the .env shape; .env.agent
# has the same three variables with the scoped key.
NEAR_ACCOUNT_ID=youraccount.testnet
NEAR_PRIVATE_KEY=ed25519:...
# Deployed policy contract (see BUILD-LOG.md)
POLICY_CONTRACT_ID=policy.agentsigspike1103.testnet
